  "title": "Easy Steak Taco",
  "description": "A tasty, easy recipe for steak tacos. Slices of grilled flank steak are served on tortillas with avocado, pickled onions, lettuce, and cabbage.",
  "authors": [
    "Avocados from Mexico"
  ],
